[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そこの人間のほうが、よっぽど我の心情を",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...That human over there seems to understand"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "理解してくれているようだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "my feelings far better than you do."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "肉親の仇に手を差し伸べられて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You think I can just shake hands"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "仲良しこよしになれるとでも？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "with the killer of my kin?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ、そうだな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, exactly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "彼女がやらないのなら私がやる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If she won't do it, then I will."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "元より、そのつもりでここまで来たのだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's why I came here in the first place!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なにっ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What...?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうだ、その傲慢さ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, that arrogance."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぐっ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gah...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それこそが我の知っている人間の姿だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That is the true nature of humans I know."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ゴゥさん！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うぐっ……これは毒……か",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... is this poison...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "く、身体が思うように動かん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can't... move my body properly..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "油断したね。お前さんは下がってな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You let your guard down. Fall back for now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "話し合いなど誰が応じるものか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Talking things out? Laughable."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "貴様ら人間はすべて滅ぼし尽くしてくれる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I will destroy every last one of you humans."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それがお前の本性か",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So that's your true nature."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "陰陽師コウセン……いや、人に仇なす大妖怪よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diviner Kosen... no, great demon who bears hatred for mankind."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鏑矢さん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "堂免鏑矢……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya Doumen...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "貴様は……貴様だけはこの手で！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You... you alone will die by my hand!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……余は確かにお前の肉親を手に掛けた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I did indeed kill your kin."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "貴様が仇討ちを願う道理も分かる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I understand why you seek revenge."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だが、復讐するなら余だけにせよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But if you must have your vengeance, that matter is between us alone!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "周りを巻き込んだ此度の騒動、許せん！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This chaos you've brought upon innocent people—I cannot forgive it!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "コウセン、親子ともども余が討ち",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I will strike down both parent and child"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この因縁を断ってくれよう！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "and put an end to this grudge!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  }
